AUDIO: 'the second photo. Change the lighting on the person so that the properly reflects the lighting patterns and environment in the bedroom. Make the photo professional studio quality with brighter lighting while maintaining a realistic skin tone and quality.'

[15:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Here is the bedroom. As you can see, it\'s quite a small image. So, we\'ll see just how well Flux 2 handles this image and repopulates the pixels without destroying the quality of the photo or'

[15:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'destroying things in the background like the stuffed animals or the desktop wallpaper and so on. And here\'s the output. I think it turned out exceptionally well. You can see that it definitely repopulated and refined the'

[16:12] [scene:talk]
